down-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Mastodon</button>\n                <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Bluesky</button>\n                <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">LinkedIn</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dropdown-separator\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n    <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Print…<span class=\"dropdown-shortcut\">⌘P</span></button>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"menubar-trigger\" data-dropdown-trigger=\"mb-edit\">Edit</button>\n  <div id=\"mb-edit\" role=\"menu\" popover class=\"dropdown-content\" aria-label=\"Edit\" style=\"min-width: 14rem\">\n    <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Undo<span class=\"dropdown-shortcut\">⌘Z</span></button>\n    <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Redo<span class=\"dropdown-shortcut\">⇧⌘Z</span></button>\n    <div class=\"dropdown-separator\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n    <div class=\"dropdown-sub\">\n      <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item dropdown-sub-trigger\" tabindex=\"-1\">Find</button>\n      <div id=\"mb-find\" role=\"menu\" popover class=\"dropdown-content dropdown-sub-content\" aria-label=\"Find\">\n        <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Search the web</button>\n        <div class=\"dropdown-separator\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n        <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Find…</button>\n        <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Find Next</button>\n        <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Find Previous</button>\n        <div class=\"dropdown-separator\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n        <div class=\"dropdown-sub\">\n          <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item dropdown-sub-trigger\" tabindex=\"-1\">Replace</button>\n          <div id=\"mb-replace\" role=\"menu\" popover class=\"dropdown-content dropdown-sub-content\" aria-label=\"Replace\">\n            <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Replace…</button>\n            <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Replace All</button>\n            <div class=\"dropdown-sub\">\n              <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item dropdown-sub-trigger\" tabindex=\"-1\">In scope</button>\n              <div\n                id=\"mb-scope\"\n                role=\"menu\"\n                popover\n                class=\"dropdown-content dropdown-sub-content\"\n                aria-label=\"In scope\"\n              >\n                <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">This file</button>\n                <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Open files</button>\n                <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Whole project</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dropdown-separator\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n    <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Cut</button>\n    <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Copy</button>\n    <button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"dropdown-item\" tabindex=\"-1\">Paste</button>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"menubar-trigger\" data-dropdown-trigger=\"mb-view\">View</button>\n  <div id=\"mb-view\" role=\"menu\" popover class=\"dropdown-content\" aria-label=\"View\" style=\"min-width: 14rem\">\n    <button role=\"menuitemcheckbox\" class=\"dropdown-item dropdown-check\" aria-checked=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"\n      >Always Show Bookmarks Bar</button\n    >\n    <button role=\"menuitemcheckbox\" class=\"dropdown-item dropdown-check\" aria-checked=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"\n      >Always Show Full URLs</button\